# Note: keystore/debug.keystore IS intentionally tracked. It uses the standard Android
# debug credentials (store/key password "android", alias "androiddebugkey"), which are
# public by convention and are not a secret. Tracking it keeps debug builds reproducible
# on machines where the home directory is not writable.
#
# The *release* key is the opposite. Public knowledge of it would let anyone sign an APK that
# installs over a genuine one, and losing it means this app can never be updated again under
# the same package name. Neither the key nor its password belongs in the repository.
keystore.properties
keystore/*.jks
keystore/*.keystore
!keystore/debug.keystore
